{"id": "7th-t1-u2-158", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u1-amudhat-tamil", "lesson_id": "ta-l4-vilangugal-ulagam", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "elephant-comparisons-match", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "ஆசிய மற்றும் ஆப்பிரிக்க யானைகளின் வேறுபாடுகளைப் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I (யானை வகை):\nL1. ஆசிய ஆண் யானை\nL2. ஆசிய பெண் யானை\nL3. ஆப்பிரிக்க ஆண் யானை\nL4. ஆப்பிரிக்க பெண் யானை\nபட்டியல் II (தந்த அமைப்பு):\nR1. தந்தம் உண்டு\nR2. தந்தம் இல்லை\nR3. தந்தம் உண்டு\nR4. தந்தம் உண்டு"}], "options": {"A": "L1-R2, L2-R1, L3-R3, L4-R4", "B": "L1-R1, L2-R2, L3-R3, L4-R4", "C": "L1-R3, L2-R4, L3-R1, L4-R2", "D": "L1-R4, L2-R3, L3-R2, L4-R1"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் விளக்கம்: ஆசிய யானைகளில் ஆணுக்குத் தந்தம் உண்டு (R1); பெண்ணுக்குத் தந்தம் இல்லை (R2); ஆப்பிரிக்க யானைகளில் ஆண், பெண் இரண்டுக்குமே தந்தம் உண்டு (R3, R4). வரிசை: 1 - 2 - 3 - 4."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "Match the Asian and African elephant classifications with their tusk characteristics:\nList I (Elephant Class):\nL1. Asian Bull Elephant\nL2. Asian Cow Elephant\nL3. African Bull Elephant\nL4. African Cow Elephant\nList II (Tusk Status):\nR1. Tusk present (தந்தம் உண்டு)\nR2. Tusk absent (தந்தம் இல்லை)\nR3. Tusk present (தந்தம் உண்டு)\nR4. Tusk present (தந்தம் உண்டு)"}], "options": {"A": "L1-R2, L2-R1, L3-R3, L4-R4", "B": "L1-R1, L2-R2, L3-R3, L4-R4", "C": "L1-R3, L2-R4, L3-R1, L4-R2", "D": "L1-R4, L2-R3, L3-R2, L4-R1"}, "explanation": "Textbook match: Asian male=Tusk present, Asian female=Tusk absent, African male=Tusk present, African female=Tusk present."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [{"id": "L1", "content_ta": "ஆசிய ஆண் யானை", "content_en": "Asian Bull Elephant"}, {"id": "L2", "content_ta": "ஆசிய பெண் யானை", "content_en": "Asian Cow Elephant"}, {"id": "L3", "content_ta": "ஆப்பிரிக்க ஆண் யானை", "content_en": "African Bull Elephant"}, {"id": "L4", "content_ta": "ஆப்பிரிக்க பெண் யானை", "content_en": "African Cow Elephant"}], "right": [{"id": "R1", "content_ta": "தந்தம் உண்டு", "content_en": "Tusk present"}, {"id": "R2", "content_ta": "தந்தம் இல்லை", "content_en": "Tusk absent"}, {"id": "R3", "content_ta": "தந்தம் உண்டு (ஆப்பிரிக்க ஆண்)", "content_en": "Tusk present (African male)"}, {"id": "R4", "content_ta": "தந்தம் உண்டு (ஆப்பிரிக்க பெண்)", "content_en": "Tusk present (African female)"}]}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "B", "accepted_keys": ["B"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 36, "chapter": null, "section": null, "reference": null, "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["7th_tamil", "match", "elephant_tusks_comparison"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "subject_expert_tamil", "verified_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "archived_at"