{"id": "7th-t1-u3-363", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "direct", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "easy", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "7", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "1", "unit_id": "ta-u3-naadu-samoogam-arasu", "lesson_id": "ta-l5-thirukkural-iraimaatchi", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "iraimaatchi-chapter-number", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "திருக்குறளில் பொருட்பாலின் தொடக்கமாக அமைந்துள்ள 'இறைமாட்சி' என்னும் அதிகாரம் எத்தனையாவது அதிகாரமாக இடம்பெற்றுள்ளது?"}], "options": {"A": "39-வது அதிகாரம்", "B": "38-வது அதிகாரம்", "C": "40-வது அதிகாரம்", "D": "41-வது அதிகாரம்"}, "explanation": "பாடநூல் குறிப்பு: ஏழாம் வகுப்பு பாடநூலில் '39. இறைமாட்சி' என்று தெளிவாகக் குறிப்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளது. பொருட்பாலின் முதல் அதிகாரம் 39-வது அதிகாரம் ஆகும்."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "As the commencement of Porutpaal in Thirukkural, which chapter number is 'Iraimaatchi'?"}], "options": {"A": "Chapter 39", "B": "Chapter 38", "C": "Chapter 40", "D": "Chapter 41"}, "explanation": "Textbook fact: 'Iraimaatchi' is Chapter 39 in Thirukkural, marking the opening chapter of Porutpaal."}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "A", "accepted_keys": ["A"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "7", "term": "1", "edition": "2024-2025", "page": 69, "chapter": null, "section": nu